# Golden vectors for log/gather_wire.situ, written by hand from its
# layouts: a query for program "app" from time 1 to 2, from the start,
# every line; a page of one line "abc", done; a ring query from the
# oldest; and a ring page of one 55-byte record of zeros, done.

